OL,3,A'I kept seeing people who'd been shot':
OL,4,ABritish tourist describes scene after
OL,5,Adeadly Krakow attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FKrakow's market square remains
OL,8,Fpartially closed 24 hours after six
OL,9,Fpeople were killed in a shooting -
OL,10,Fhere's what we do and don't know so far
OL,12,FFifteen people who were injured in the
OL,13,Fshooting are now stable, including two
OL,14,Fpolice officers who have emerged from
OL,15,Fcomas - the suspect remains in critical
OL,16,Fcondition
OL,18,FThree other bodies were found at the
OL,19,Fsuspect's home, and were later
OL,20,Fidentified as the man's parents and
OL,21,Fsister
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
