OL,3,A'I kept seeing people who'd been shot':
OL,4,ABritish tourist describes scene after
OL,5,Adeadly Krakow attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FEyewitness Tom Brook tells the BBC he
OL,8,F"kept seeing people who'd been shot" in
OL,9,Fthe aftermath of the attack; another,
OL,10,FRuby Warren, describes hearing
OL,11,Fgunshots: "I yelled at my friends to
OL,12,Frun and we all sprinted for our lives"
OL,14,FThe Krakow branch of Poland's National
OL,15,FProsecutor's Office says the shooting
OL,16,Fin the city centre constitutes "a
OL,17,Fterrorist offence"
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
